.SS "Caching"
zshrs caches the compiled completion graph as rkyv shards under
.IR ~/.cache/zshrs/ ;
the daemon invalidates them when any file in
.B $fpath
changes. First-time
.B compinit
on a fresh machine takes typical zsh time; subsequent shell starts
mmap the cache and skip parse entirely.
